WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
Covering one day after the other, one day after the other, we have come to the closing day of the 10 days Thamma seminar.

00:20.000 --> 00:36.000
When you started your work, you surrendered yourself, surrendered to this technique.

00:36.000 --> 00:50.000
It was very essential. Otherwise one does not give fair trial to the technique.

00:50.000 --> 01:00.000
One joins a camp like this to give a trial to the technique, to give full justice to the technique.

